{"c":[{"name":"20261022T024529Z-428ab7ddc503aa7e","text":"Live-copy measurements 2026-10-21 (DuckDB 2.0.0): DROP INDEX + CHECKPOINT took 0.8 s and cut used blocks 161,453 to 6,846 (37.4 GiB freed in the file); COPY FROM DATABASE then gave a 506 MB file in 5.2 s. Exact top-100 search: 130 ms median vs 34 ms HNSW.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261022T041848Z-871fed0b54c48740","text":"Operator 2026-10-21: drop the HNSW index (two-way door; a later CREATE INDEX can restore it). Reverses 'HNSW stays'. Exact top-100 over 133,793 vectors is 130 ms on 2.0.0. Needs an L4 milestone re-plan.","type":"note"}]}
